# Pairs with OrphanEventuallyRetired. A protocol defect with fairness intact: the
# enumeration reads a key but never records what it found under it, so no pin is
# ever decided.
MODULE: OrphanEventuallyRetiredEnumFindsNothing
TARGET: OrphanEventuallyRetired
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the enumeration records no pin it reads
PERTURBS: Enum

--- FIND
                    [c \in Cons |-> IF Present(k, c) /\ (p # Drive \/ c = "cL")
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: nothing found is recorded.
                    [c \in Cons |-> IF FALSE
--- END
